  epo:hasLegalBasis <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/legal-basis/32014L0024>;
  epo:hasProcurementScopeDividedIntoLot <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/fdb7e598-e930-49d5-83c6-383934efe130-01/Lot/LOT-0001>;
  epo:hasPurpose <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/fdb7e598-e930-49d5-83c6-383934efe130-01/ProcedurePurpose$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProject1>;
  epo:isSubjectToTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/fdb7e598-e930-49d5-83c6-383934efe130-01/ProcessPlanningTerm$_PriorInformationNotice1_PlannedDate1>;
  dct:description """Oppegård church is located in Oppegård parish in Nordre Follo municipality.

It was built in wood and was erected in 1876.

The church has a rectangle plan and 200 seats.

The Church has listed (after 1850) (D1).

Oppegård Church is within the landscape protection area in Svartskog.

The church building now needs surface treatment and Q2/Q3-2026 shall be carried out.

Surface treatment, externally, of standing wood panels/outer covers, windskis, cornice tables, deck tables, roof spreading, eaves, windows and doors.

Surface treatment railings made of metal.

Option for washing shale roofs, external stairs/ramp and foundations.

The facade must be used as a work platform, which is assembled simultaneously around the entire church building, preferably preferred as light metal.

"""@en;
  dct:title "External surface treatment Oppegård Church"@en .

